# Secrets
.env

# Data is reproducible from `nfl-props ingest run` and stays out of git...
data/*
!data/odds/
data/odds/*

# ...with ONE exception. Prop snapshots are the CLV record: they cannot be
# re-downloaded (historical props are paid-tier) and cannot be reconstructed
# after the fact. They are small, immutable and append-only, so they are
# versioned rather than left to die with a container or a laptop.
!data/odds/props/

# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
*.egg-info/
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.coverage
htmlcov/

# nflreadpy's own on-disk cache
.nflreadpy_cache/

# Generated weekly reports. Reproducible from `nfl-props report weekly`, and
# the scheduled workflow regenerates and commits `reports/latest.md` itself --
# a hand-run copy would be stale the moment the next snapshot lands.
reports/*
!reports/latest.md
